{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_spec", "label": "ICRR Journal Website Design Spec", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L1-31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Approved for planning, dated 2026-07-26. Two halves in one project: the 10-view public site and the backend plus admin panel that let a non-developer run it."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_decisions", "label": "Technology Decisions and Rejections", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L34-56", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Next.js 15 App Router because 10 views map to file routes and the admin needs a server; Tailwind v4 CSS-first @theme so tokens live as CSS variables and arbitrary values carry the one-off clamp() sizes verbatim; Netlify and Supabase because both are already in use; TipTap JSON for article bodies because editors will paste from Word; Resend for email; supabase-js with generated types so there is no second ORM. Explicitly rejected: static export, a headless CMS, porting the prototype runtime, the single-file page-state pattern, and a public user system."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_data_model", "label": "Postgres Data Model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L199-294", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "site_config (single row), disciplines, team_members, editorial_roles, authors, issues, articles, article_authors, announcements, ticker_lines, submissions, newsletter_subscribers. Dates render as 'TBA' when null, matching the prototype."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_storage_buckets", "label": "Three Storage Buckets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L287-294", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "media (public read), article-pdfs (public read), manuscripts (private, reached only by short-lived signed URLs in the admin)."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_security_model", "label": "Default-Deny Security Model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L297-333", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RLS enabled on every table with no permissive policy as the baseline. Anon gets select only, scoped per table; submissions and newsletter_subscribers get none. Two-layer gate: middleware alone is not treated as sufficient because a server action is reachable by direct POST. Path obscurity via ADMIN_PATH is a second layer, not the control. Uploads validated server-side and filenames regenerated, never taken from the client. Rate limiting on public submission and newsletter endpoints."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_public_routes", "label": "Public Routes and Their Data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L336-362", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rule: public pages import content only from src/lib/content/. No page touches Supabase directly."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_announcement_rotator", "label": "Announcement Rotator (6000ms cycle)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L420", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spec \u00a79 keeps the prototype's swap-every-6000ms rotator with the interval cleared on unmount. Later superseded by the continuous CSS ticker documented in the handoff README and the root README."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_admin_panel", "label": "Admin Panel Sections", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L435-456", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Editing UI follows the journal's own visual language rather than introducing a second design system. Forms are server actions with Zod validation on the server; the client mirrors the same schema for inline errors."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_submissions_email", "label": "Submissions and Email Flow", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L459-479", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If Resend is unconfigured or fails, the submission is still stored and the failure is logged. A stored submission is never lost to an email problem. Newsletter upserts so a repeat signup is not an error. Where an article PDF is absent the affordance is hidden rather than shown as a dead link."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_copy_rules", "label": "Spec Copy Rules (two)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L494-503", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The spec carries only two rules: no em dashes, and never promise reviewer feedback. The third rule, never naming a review model or a reviewer count, is added later in the handoff README and the root README."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_build_phases", "label": "Eight Build Phases", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L507-524", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Scaffold, Schema, Chrome, Public views, Behavior, Admin, Submissions, Verify and deploy. Each phase ends in a working, reviewable state; rebuild merges to main at phase 8."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_out_of_scope", "label": "Out of Scope", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L528-539", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Peer-review workflow, author or reviewer accounts, DOI/ORCID/Crossref, full-text search, multi-language, analytics. The schema does not preclude any of these; none is built now."}, {"id": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_open_items", "label": "Open Items Blocking Deploy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L543-557", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supabase keys, admin account, Resend key and verified sender, chosen ADMIN_PATH, real photographs, real author profiles. All owned by the client. These do not block building; they block deploying."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_spec", "target": "design_reference_icrr_journal_dc_component", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L5-6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_spec", "target": "design_reference_readme_handoff", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L5-6, L152-153, L351", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_spec", "target": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_decisions", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L34", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_decisions", "target": "design_reference_readme_do_not_port_runtime", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L53-54", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_data_model", "target": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_storage_buckets", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L287", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_security_model", "target": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_data_model", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L299-310", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_data_model", "target": "design_reference_icrr_journal_dc_authors", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-26-icrr-journal-website-design.md", "source_location": "L241-243", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_2026_07_26_icrr_journal_website_design_data_model", "